 "about": "Corrections to the sketch-map territories (historical-basemaps) that are drawn under the Cliopatria states for 3400 BC to 1885. The sketch maps exist only for some years and reuse outlines, so a people or state can appear centuries before it existed or long after it ended. 'spans': a territory with this name is drawn only between 'from' and 'to' (either may be missing). 'rename': between 'from' and 'to' the territory is shown under another name, optionally with a ruler and the ruler's colour key. No outline is changed or added. Years are the commonly cited ones from the Wikipedia article named in 'source'; 'verified' is true where Wikidata's inception or dissolution year for the linked item is the same (within a few years).",
